  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Connecting Classrooms: supporting links between UK schools and schools in developing countries</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To support partnerships between schools in the UK and developing countries and to enable teachers to teach young people about global poverty and international issues and to improve their teaching in other curriculum areasTo support partnerships between schools in the UK and developing countries and to enable teachers to teach young people about global poverty and international issues and to improve their teaching in other curriculum areasTo support partnerships between schools in the UK and developing countries and to enable teachers to teach young people about global poverty and international issues and to improve their teaching in other curriculum areasTo support partnerships between schools in the UK and developing countries and to enable teachers to teach young people about global poverty and international issues and to improve their teaching in other curriculum areasDFID funding is supporting partnerships between schools in the UK and developing countries and training for teachers so they can use these partnerships to teach young people about global poverty and international issues and to improve their teaching in other curriculum areas</narrative>
  </description>
